Article 3 (Transitional Measures concerning Reporting of Railroad Fares and Charges)
The fares and charges for railroads operated, as at the time this Decree enters into force, by the Korea Railroad Corporation established under the Korea Railroad Corporation Act (hereinafter referred to as the "Korea Railroad Corporation") shall be deemed fares and charges reported to the Minister of Construction and Transportation pursuant to Article 3.

